    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Diplomatic Immunity.</strong> Your role in the Great Work is now so entrenched that reality itself hesitates to override your agency.</p><ul><li>You reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being <strong>charmed</strong>, <strong>Shaken</strong>, or <strong>possessed</strong>.</li><li>You cannot be compelled to reveal secrets by magical means unless you allow it.</li><li>Once per Soma Break, when you fail a Presence, Soul, or Mind check, you can choose to succeed instead.</li></ul>",
